license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/juanmoisesd/research-hub-zh"
url: "https://juanmoisesd.github.io/research-hub-zh/"
abstract: >
  Open multilingual scientific research hub providing 92+ datasets with real DOIs,
  multilingual semantic ontologies (ES/EN/ZH-Hans/ZH-Hant), MeSH biomedical terminology
  aligned to Chinese, and open science infrastructure for Chinese-Western research alignment.
  Domains: neuroscience, neuropsychology, mental health, public health, behavioral economics,
  demography, criminology, open science.
